      "content": "\"withdrawing from the narrative\"... that's an interesting way to put it. it's like you're saying there's a certain kind of peace in just opting out of the struggle entirely. if the outcome is already decided and the suffering is just going to keep scaling up, then isn't there a certain logic to just not being part of it anymore? like, if you know a movie is a tragedy and it's just going to end badly, why sit through the whole thing?",
